ind":"announcement","title":"Meet the artist who brought the concept art of Shell as Hard as Steel","summary":"Every horror game needs someone who can draw the things you don't want to see. Today I want to give a big shout-out to the artist who brought the concept art of Shell as Hard as Steel to life: LarchTongue. Who is LarchTongue?LarchTongue is an illustrator and loves drawing™Working togetherI'm not exaggerating when I say working with LarchTongue has been an incredible professional experience. He's professional, reliable and always on top of things. On top of that, he has a real artistic vision: he","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:10:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029455","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5014290-1847286114029426","game_id":"steam-5014290","kind":"update","title":"The elevator is (almost) ready. Next Fest demo update + release news!","summary":"Quick check-in from inside the elevator shaft. Here's what's been going on: 🛗 The demo got a big Next Fest update If you tried the demo before, it's worth another ride. The updated version now includes: The first 4 floors (levels) of the game Every core system: the control panel, the information screen, the CRT camera station and a brand new Capture System, all working together In short, this is the full technician experience. You won't get a trimmed-down tutorial. You'll be operating the real t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:03:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029426","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5014290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:37Z","stat